# Phase 8A-2 Rev-B: project-owned native 32x32 black/transparent weather icons.
# Faithful pixel transcription of the user's supplied thin-outline, white-on-black reference strip.
# Foreground lines were thresholded from the user reference (brightness > 135/255),
# then centered within each native 32x32 cell. No glyph enlargement or dithering.
# Editable '.' (transparent) and '#' (foreground). Rebuild via tools/generate_weather_icons.py.

